caption: Subtle — Retractable Anatomy
tradition-component: subtle-retractable-anatomy

A Subtle Spawn may apply Switchable to any Super or Psi trait whose supernatural function is represented by an embodied physical modification, even when that advantage would not normally be eligible for Switchable. When the trait is switched off, the associated supernatural anatomy retracts, disappears, seals over, or otherwise ceases to exist as an active body part; any Sign caused solely by that anatomy also disappears, and the trait provides no benefit.

Subtle also grants purchase permission for Reduced Time or another ordinary Takes Less Time construction that speeds this switching, and for Reflexive when the underlying trait and final build support an immediate or automatic manifestation. These enhancements are fully point-paid and do not waive any other activation or action requirement not actually modified by the purchased enhancement.

Multiple Subtle traits may be built with Linked so that they manifest and retract together as one anatomical group. Each component pays for its own legal Linked construction. A Linked group does not make one trait pay for the others and grants no free abilities; it simply synchronizes their activation. This is the normal way to build a complex structure such as a mouth opening together with tentacles, constriction organs, and associated sensory tissue.
